        "description": "**TURN YOUR HOME INTO AN OBSTACLE COURSE FOR ANIMALS**\n\nPet & Run is a mixed-reality game where players create crazy obstacle courses for their favorite pets and then race on them for the best time.\n\nThe gameplay is a mix of a platforming and racing experience with a twist.\n\nThe more you pet your animal, the faster it runs.\nExplore new levels daily, create your own, and challenge friends or other players in thrilling matches.\n\n**The free early access version of the game comes with 30 pre-built levels, 3 animals to unlock, online leaderboards and a multiplayer sandbox mode with more animals and content joining the fun soon!**\n\nJoin our Discord to become part of the Pet & Run community and help us improve the game!",
